---
title: How to rename a document
sidebar:
  order: 7
---
**To rename a document, follow these steps:**

- **Navigate to Documents: From the sidebar, click on the Documents section (Step 2).**

- **Locate the Document: Find the document you wish to rename in the list.**

- **Open the Options Menu: Click on the three-dot menu beside the document name (Step 3).**

- **Select Rename: Choose the “Rename” option from the dropdown (Step 4).**

- **Rename the Document: A pop-up window will appear, allowing you to enter a new name for the document. Enter the desired name and click on Submit to save the change.**
